nchyma consists of mature  lobular  yellow  adipose tissue with thick  intercollating  fibrous bands  The axillary tail is explored for lymph nodes  Several lymph nodes are identified  Section Code  A  biopsy cavity with scar and superior margin  B  deep inked margin overlying biopsy site  C D  remainder of biopsy site  E G  fibrotic areas near biopsy site  H I  fibrosis at deep inked margin inferior to biopsy site  J  fibrosis at inferior margin  K  nipple  L O  low nodes  P Q  middle nodes  R  high nodes  Resident  JAMES J  TIESINGA  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  David William Rattner  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT   MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY   report_end  , Unchecked.
