Accession Number   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  Report Status  FinalType  Surgical Pathology Pathology Report   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  OPERATION DATE  02 REMOVED_MONTH 04 ACCESSIONED ON  02 REMOVED_MONTH 04 at 10 19 CLINICAL DATA  Left breast colloid carcinoma                                                                                      FINAL DIAGNOSIS     BREAST  LEFT   RE EXCISION  FOCAL DUCTAL CARCINOMA IN SITU  GRADE 1  EXTENDING TO THE MEDIOPOSTERIOR MARGIN AND REMOVED_DATE CM FROM THE POSTERIOR MARGIN  ATYPICAL DUCTAL HYPERPLASIA  HEALING BIOPSY SITE  BREAST  LEFT  FINAL SHAVED MARGIN   EXCISION  SINGLE FOCUS OF SEVERELY ATYPICAL DUCTAL HYPERPLASIA  BORDERING ON DUCTAL CARCINOMA IN SITU  HEALING BIOPSY SITE  Diagnosis by  MELINDA J  LERWILL  M D  Signed On  04 REMOVED_MONTH 04 at 15 31                                                                                 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  re excision  left breast short stitch superior  long stitch lateral  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm fragment of fibrofatty soft tissue which is oriented by a short suture which is designated the superior margin and a long suture designated lateral margin  The specimen is inked as follows  medial green  lateral yellow  posterior black  The anterior surface of the specimen consist of a glistening  shaggy fibrotic surface which is consistent with a previous excision site  Sectioning shows the cavity to be surrounded by chalky yellow tan fat necrosis and extensive fibrosis towards the inferior region of the specimen  The specimen is submitted in its entirety from superior to inferior in a sequential order in cassettes A J  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  final shaved margin  left breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm aggregate of tan yellow fibrofatty soft tissue and white fibrous tissue  The fragments are serially sectioned and