y is located 0 6cm from the closest posterior margin  1 5cm from the closest anterior margin  2 3cm from the closest skin surface  No residual tumor is grossly identified  The remaining breast parenchyma is fibrofatty and grossly unremarkable  The specimen is submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Relationship of the biopsy cavity to the closest posterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   The relationship of the biopsy cavity to the closest anterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Biopsy cavity and skin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Additional representative section of the biopsy cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of the stellate fibrotic area next to the cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Additional representative section of the fibrous tissue away from the cavity  No lymph nodes are identified in the area designated as axillary tail  Representative section of the adipose tissue from this area is submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Gross Dictation by Julia Turbiner M D   on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Julia Turbiner M D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Kristina Braaten M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART   BREAST  LEFT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY , Checked.
