east tissue  Resident  LISA A  GALLAGHER  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  O R  Resident  RUBEN D  CARRASCO  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Dennis Sgroi  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Michael Ned Margolies  M D  George Tolis Jr   M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY PART B  BREAST  LEFT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY PART C   DEEP MARGIN    report_end  , Checked.
