 percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  08 REMOVED_MONTH 96 at 15 14 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number and  right breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm lumpectomy specimen which is inked and sectioned to reveal an ill defined  pale  tan firm nodule  1 0cm in maximum dimension  abutting an inked margin  This specimen is submitted entirely in cassettes A H  Resident  CHIN LEE WU  MD  PhD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DIAGNOSIS  SMALL HIGHLY SUSPICIOUS LESION  AWAIT PERMANENTS  O R  Resident  Timothy R  Quinn  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Judith Ann Ferry  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART   RIGHT BREAST  RE EXCISION   report_end  , Unchecked.
