ROSS DESCRIPTION  Received are 6 containers  which are all  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN  Received fresh in the Frozen Sectio Laboratory  labeled  left axillary sentinel  700   is a 2 x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm red tan soft tissue containing a tan blue lymph node  which is bisected and entirely frozen as FX  1  now submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   The remainder of the fibroadipose tissue is submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh in the Frozen Section Laboratory  labeled  sentinel node  right axilla  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm red tan soft tissue containing a blue tan lymph node which is bisected and entirely frozen as FX  2  now submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh labeled  left breast  is a mastectomy specimen measuring 18 x 13 x 3 0cm with a skin ellipse measuring REMOVED_DATE x 2 4cm with an unremarkable nipple measuring 1 3cm in greatest dimension  The specimen is oriented with a short stitch designating the superior aspect and a long stitch designating the lateral aspect  The anterior is inked blue and the posterior is inked black  and the specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a biopsy site with surrounding tissue firmness measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm  The biopsy site contains a clip  The firm area is located 0 9cm from the anterior margin and 1 4cm from the posterior margin  The remainder of the parenchyma is notable only for a 0 6cm nodule in the upper inner quadrant  Remainder of the parenchyma consists of yellow tan adipose tissue and white fibrous parenchyma with focal cyst formation  Representative sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Biopsy site with surrounding fibrosis  submitted entirely   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Upper inner quadrant nodule   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Lower outer quadrant slightly nodular parenchyma  Received fresh labeled  right breast  is a simple mastectomy specimen measuring 16 x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm with a skin ellipse measuring REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm containing an unremarkable nipple measuring 1 4cm in greatest diameter  The specimen has been oriented by the surgeon with a short stitch designating the superior aspect and a long stitch designating the lateral aspect  The anterior aspect is inked blue  the posterior is inked black  and the specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a hemorrhagic excisional cavity measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm  The cavity is located 0 2cm from the anterior aspect and 1 0cm from the posterior margin of resection  The remainder of the specimen is notable only for blue injection dye  The remainder of the specimen consists of yellow adipose tissue with white fibrous parenchyma  Representative sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Medial aspect of biopsy cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Full thickness cross section of biopsy cavity including to anterior and posterior margins   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Full thickness cross section of excisional cavity including anterior and posterior margins   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Further sections of excisional cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Lobulated breast parenchyma  upper outer   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Lobular breast parenchyma  inferior to biopsy cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Lobulated breast parenchyma  inferior to biopsy cavity  Received fresh  labeled  additional margin  right   are multiple fragments of yellow fibroadipose tissue aggregating to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm  The specimen is received unoriented  the external surface is inked black  and the specimen is entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin  labeled  additional margin  left   are multiple fragments of yellow tan adipose tissue aggregating to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm  The specimen is received unoriented  the external surface is inked black  and the specimen is serially sectioned and entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received are 2 additional containers which are  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN  Received in formalin  labeled  left breast skin   are 3 skin ellipses measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE  REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE  and REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm  The ellipses are excised to an average depth of 0 3cm  The deep aspects of all ellipses are inked black  and the specimens are each bisected and entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin  labeled  right breast skin   is a skin ellipse measuring REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm  excised to a depth of 0 2cm  The deep aspect is inked black  The specimen is bisected and entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS  FROZEN SECTION  1   LEFT AXILLA  SENTINEL NODE  700   THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  2   RIGHT AXILLA  SENTINEL NODE   REMOVED_CASE_ID    THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  Final Diagnosis by Melinda J Lerwill M D   Electronically signed on Saturday REMOVED_MONTH 25   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 11 52 15PM By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  PART A  Lymph Node  Left Axilla   Sentinel    Excision PART B  Lymph Node  Right Axilla   Sentinel    REMOVED_CASE_ID    Excision PART C  Breast  Left   Simple Mastectomy PART D  Breast  Right   Simple Mastectomy PART E  Breast  Right  Additional Superficial Margin   Excision PART F  Breast  Left Additional Superfi  report_end  , Checked.
